<div class="wp-block-group hero-split is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="hero__media"><img src="{{ 'art-03.webp' | asset_url }}" width="1169" height="1600" alt="Painting of a scarecrow in a flowered hat standing in a field of sunflowers, made on commission" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"></div>

<div class="wp-block-group hero-split__text is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<p class="hero__eyebrow">A piece for you</p>

<h1 class="wp-block-heading">Commissions</h1>

<p class="hero__lede has-large-font-size">Have a project in mind? I love working from your stories, your ideas, and the images you carry within you. Whether it’s a gouache illustration, a watercolor painting, or ink artwork, we always begin with a conversation to define the scope, format, timeline, and budget.</p>

<div class="wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-button"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="#formulaire">Request a commission</a></div>
<div class="wp-block-button is-style-outline"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="{{ pages['portfolio'].url }}">View the portfolios</a></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>


<div class="wp-block-group alignwide band is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="wp-block-group band__head is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<h2 class="wp-block-heading">How it works</h2>
</div>

<div class="wp-block-group band__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<ol class="wp-block-list steps"><li>You get in touch with your idea or project.</li><li>We discuss the subject, dimensions, medium, timeline, and price together.</li><li>A commission agreement is confirmed, and a 50% deposit is required to reserve your spot and begin the work.</li><li>I then move into the research and sketching phase.</li><li>I send you sketches for approval. Up to three rounds of revisions are included at this stage.</li><li>Once the final sketch is approved, I begin the artwork.</li><li>When the piece is finished, two minor revisions are included if small adjustments are needed.</li><li>The artwork is then carefully packaged and shipped with tracked, secure delivery.</li><li>A certificate of authenticity is included with every original painting.</li><li>The remaining balance is due before final shipment.</li></ol>
</div>
</div>


<div class="wp-block-group alignwide band is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="wp-block-group band__head is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Pricing and timelines</h2>
</div>

<div class="wp-block-group band__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="wp-block-group note has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">

<p>My pricing is based on several factors: the complexity of the subject, the size of the artwork, the medium used, the level of detail, the amount of research involved, and the time required to complete the piece. Since every project is unique, timelines also vary depending on the scope of the work and my availability at the time of the commission.</p>


<p>As a guideline, an original 9 x 12 inch gouache illustration starts at 400 CAD and may range from 400 to 650 CAD depending on the complexity of the project. For more detailed requests involving multiple characters, an elaborate background, or a highly refined finish, a higher price may apply.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>


<div class="wp-block-group alignwide band is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="wp-block-group band__head is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Commission agreement</h2>
</div>

<div class="wp-block-group band__body is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow">

<div class="wp-block-group note has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">

<p>To keep the process clear and reassuring for everyone, each commission includes a written agreement outlining the subject of the project, the price, the deposit, the timeline, the number of revisions included, and the delivery terms. This helps set expectations from the start and ensures a smooth process from beginning to end.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>


<div class="wp-block-group alignwide form-band is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow" id="formulaire">
